# --- Third-party asset packs kept OUT of git ---
# Large Asset Store packs we're only trialling. Share via Drive, not the repo,
# so we don't burn LFS quota or bloat history. Each dev imports them locally.
# If a pack graduates to "we're actually shipping this", remove its line here
# and commit it properly (LFS-tracked) — and tell the other dev.
Unity/Assets/09RetroBowl/
